(12, 'ဆီးချိုသမားများ ဆီးချိုကျတဲ့အခါ', 6, 17, '<div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 24px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">ဆီးချို</span>သမား ဖြစ်ရတာ မလွယ်ပါဘူး။ သူတို့မှာ <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">ဆီးချိုတက်</span>မှာကြောက်ရ ဆီးချိုကျမှာကြောက်ရနဲ့။ <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">အစားအသောက်</span>တွေ မထိန်းဘဲ စားလိုက်ရင်လဲ ဆီးချိုတွေက မိုးထိုးနေပြန်ပြီ။ ရှောင်မယ် ဘာမှမစားဘူးဆိုပြန်တော့လည်း ဆီးချိုတွေကျလိုက်တာများ မူးလို့။ ဒီနေ့တော့ ဆီးချိုသမားများ ဆီးချိုကျတဲ့အခါ ဖြစ်တတ်တဲ့အကြောင်းကို ပြောပြပေးပါမယ်။ ဆီးချိုကျရင် ရုတ်တရက်မူးဝေပြီး သတိလစ်တတ်တာကြောင့် အချိန်မီမကုနိုင်ရင် အသက်ဆုံးရှုံးနိုင်ပါတယ်။ ဒါကြောင့် ဆီးချိုကျတဲ့လက္ခဏာတွေကို သိထားသင့်ပါတယ်။</p></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 26px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; line-height: 36px; letter-spacing: -0.8px; margin-block: 16px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; font-weight: inherit;\">ဆီးချိုသမားများ ဆီးချိုကျတဲ့အခါ ဘယ်လိုခံစားရမှာလဲ။</strong></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px;\">​လက်ထိပ်ဖောက်ကြည့်လိုက်လို့ <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">သွေးတွင်းသကြားဓာတ်</span> 70mg/dL (3.9mmol/L)အောက်ဆိုရင် ဆီးချိုကျတယ်လို့ ပြောလို့ရပါတယ်။ လက္ခဏာရှိရှိ မရှိမရှိပါ။</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 24px;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%;\">ဆီးချိုကျတဲ့ အစောပိုင်းလက္ခဏာတွေကတော့</em></p></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1rem; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; list-style: inside; max-width: 100%; margin-block: 16px; white-space: normal;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text