ng: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div id=\"google_ads_iframe_/21682272649/HelloSayarwonDesktop/HelloSayarwonDesktop_BloodDisorders/Anaemia_4__container__\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0pt none; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline;\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><h2 data-title=\"သွေးအားနည်းရောဂါ (Anemia) ဆိုတာ\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 32px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; line-height: 42px; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-block: 16px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\">သွေးအားနည်းရောဂါ (Anemia) ဆိုတာ</h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">ခန္ဓာကိုယ်</span>ထဲက <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">သွေးနီဥဆဲလ်</span> ထဲမှာ ဟေမိုဂလိုဘင်ဓာတ်တွေ နည်းသွားတဲ့အခါ သွေးအားနည်းရောဂါ (Anemia) ဖြစ်လာပါတယ်။ သွေးနီဥဆဲလ်တွေက ခန္ဓာကိုယ်က တစ်ရှူးတွေဆီကို အောက်ဆီဂျင်တွေသယ်ပို့ပေးတာပါ။</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">သွေးနီဥဆဲလ်အရေအတွက် နည်းသွားတဲ့အခါ&nbsp; ကိုယ်ထဲမှာ <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">အောက်ဆီဂျင်ပမာဏ</span> ကျသွားတတ်ပါတယ်။ သွေးအားနည်းရောဂါရဲ့ အတွေ့ရ အများဆုံး လက္ခဏာက ခန္ဓာကိုယ်ရဲ့ အရေးပါတဲ့ <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">တစ်ရှူးတွေ</span>နဲ့ <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">အင်္ဂါအစိတ်အပိုင်းတွေ</span>ဆီကို အောက်ဆီဂျင် လုံလောက်အောင် မရောက်ရှိတာပါ။</p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"></span><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">သွေးအားနည်းရောဂါ ခံစားနေရသလားဆိုတာကို သွေးနီဥဆဲလ်တွေထဲက ပရိုတင်း တစ်မျိုးဖြစ်တဲ့ ဟီမိုဂလိုဘင်ကို တိုင်းတာပြီး သိရှိနိုင်ပါတယ်။ အမျိုးသမီးတွေနဲ့ ကင်ဆာလိုမျိုး <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">နာတာရှည်ရောဂါ</span>တွေ ခံစားနေရသူတွေမှာ သွေးအားနည်းရောဂါ ဖြစ်နိုင်ခြေ များပါတယ်။</p><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacin