mal;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><b>အသားအရောင်ဖျော့တော့တာ</b></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><b>နှလုံးခုန်နှုန်း မမှန်တာ</b></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><b>အသက်ရှူတာ ပြတ်တောင်းပြတ်တောင်း ဖြစ်တာ</b></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><b>ရင်ဘတ်အောင့်တာ</b></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><b>ခေါင်းကိုက်တာ</b></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><b>ခေါင်းထဲမှာ ပေါ့ပေါ့က