res: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"></span><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">သွေးအရည်ကနေ သွေးအခဲ အဖြစ် ပြောင်းလဲစေဖို့ သွေးမွှားဥတွေနဲ့ သွေးခဲစေတဲ့ ပရိုတင်းဓါတ်ပစ္စည်းတစ်မျိုးကို လိုအပ်ပါတယ်။ အကယ်၍ သင့်မှာ မူမမှန်သွေးထွက်ခြင်း ရှိနေမယ်ဆိုရင် သွေးမွှားဥတွေ၊ သွေးခဲစေတဲ့ ဓါတ်ပစ္စည်းတွေက မလုံလောက်တာ ဖြစ်နိုင်သလို ပုံမှန်အတိုင်း အလုပ်မလုပ်တာ လည်း ဖြစ်နိုင်ပါတယ်။</p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"></span><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">မူမမှန်သွေးထွက်ခြင်း အများစုကတော့ မိဘကနေ ကလေးဆီကို ပါလာတဲ့ မွေးရာပါ ရောဂါအမျိုးအစား ဖြစ်ပါတယ်။ တချို့ မူမှန်သွေးထွက်တာတွေကတော့ အသည်းရောဂါ လို အခြေအနေ မျိုးတွေကြောင့်လည်း ဖြစ်နိုင်ပါတယ်။</p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"></span><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">မူမမှန်သွေးထွက်ခြင်းက အောက်ပါ အချက်တွေကြောင့် ဖြစ်လာနိုင်ပါတယ်။</p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"></span><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1rem; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; list-style: inside; max-width: 100%; margin-block: 16px; white-space: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">သွေးနီဥ နည်းပါးခြင်း</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">ဗိုက်တာမင် ကေ ချို့တဲ့ခြင်း</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">ဆေးသောက်တဲ့ အခါ ဖြစ်လာတဲ့ ဘေးထွက်ဆိုးကျိုးများ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-line\">သွေးခဲတာကို တားဆီးတဲ့ ဆေးဝါးတွေကို သွေးကျဲဆေးလို့ ခေါ်ပါတယ်။</span></li></ul><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"></span><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px;\"></p></div></div><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 24px; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></p><p></p>', '2024-02-10 02:53:46', NULL, 1, 'Hemophilia-(မူမမှန်သွေးထွက်ခြင်း)', '0527a28fb64116b07429535950b6d6edjpeg', NULL, 'admin', NULL);
