(25, 'သွေးဆိပ်သင့်ခြင်း', 7, 14, '<div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 24px;\">သွေးဆိပ်သင့် တယ်ဆိုတာ ခန္ဓာကိုယ်ထဲကို ရောဂါပိုးဝင်တာတဲ့အခါ <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">ခုခံအားစနစ်</span>က ဓာတ်ပစ္စည်းတွေကို ထုတ်ပြီး ပြန်တိုက်ခိုက်လို့ ဖြစ်လာတာပါ။ ဒီရောဂါက ဆိုးရွားပြီး သေနိုင်လောက်တဲ့အထိ ပြင်းထန်ပါတယ်။ သွေးဆိပ်သင့် တာကို ၃ဆင့်ခွဲလို့ ရပါတယ်။</p></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" da