(37, 'သွေးတိုးရောဂါ (Hypertension)', 8, 18, '<div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 24px;\">သွေးတိုးရောဂါ (Hypertension) လို့ ဆိုလိုက်ရင် လူအများစုက သေနိုင်လောက်တဲ့ ကျန်းမာရေးပြဿနာ မဟုတ်ပါဘူး။ အသက်အန္တရာယ် မစိုးရိမ်ရတဲ့ အပယိကရောဂါ လိုမျိုး သဘောထား တတ်ကြပါတယ်။ တကယ်ကတော့ သွေးတိုးက အသက်အန္တရာယ်ကို ထိခိုက်စေသည်အထိ ပြင်းထန်ပါတယ်။</p></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 24px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">သွေးတိုးခြင်း</span>ဟာ နှလုံးကို ထိခိုက်ပျက်စီးစေတဲ့ အခြေအနေ ဖြစ်ပါတယ်။ ကမ္ဘာတလွှားမှာ လူပေါင်း တစ်ဘီလျံခန့်ကို ဒုက္ခပေးနေတဲ့ ရောဂါလည်း ဖြစ်ပါတယ်။ ထိရောက်စွာ မကုသခဲ့ရင် နှလုံးရောဂါ၊ လေဖြတ်ခြင်း စတဲ့အခြေအနေတွေ တွေ့ကြုံနိုင်ပါတယ်။</p></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><div class=\"percentages-5-of-article\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%;\"></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"article-mobile-ad ad-afterimage mantine-1avyp1d\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: -1rem 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing