ext-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><h2 id=\"%e1%80%9e%e1%80%bd%e1%80%b1%e1%80%b8%e1%80%90%e1%80%ad%e1%80%af%e1%80%b8%e1%80%9b%e1%80%b1%e1%80%ac%e1%80%82%e1%80%ab-%e1%80%9e%e1%80%bd%e1%80%b1%e1%80%b8%e1%80%95%e1%80%b1%e1%80%ab%e1%80%84%e1%80%ba\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 32px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; line-height: 42px; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-block: 16px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); scroll-margin: 70px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; font-weight: inherit;\">သွေးတိုးရောဂါ (သွေးပေါင်တက်ခြင်း)</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px;\">သွေးတိုးရောဂါ (သွေးပေါင်တက်ခြင်း) ဆိုတာ အပေါ်သွေး သွေးပေါင်ချိန် ၁၄၀ နဲ့ထက်၊ အောက်သွေး ၉၀ နဲ့ အထက် (သွေးပေါင်ချိန် ၁၄၀/ ၉၀ mmHg) အထက် ဖြစ်နေတဲ့ အချိန်မှာ တွေ့ရတဲ့ နှလုံးသွေးကြောဆိုင်ရာ အခြေအနေတစ်ရပ်ပါ။ ကျန်းမာတဲ့ သွေးပေါင်ချိန် ဆိုတာက သွေးပေါင်ချိန် တိုင်းတဲ့အခါ ၁၂၀/၈၀ mmHg အောက်ရှိရမှာပါ။</p><h2 id=\"%e1%80%98%e1%80%9a%e1%80%ba%e1%80%9c%e1%80%ad%e1%80%af%e1%80%9c%e1%80%80%e1%80%b9%e1%80%81%e1%80%8f%e1%80%ac%e1%80%90%e1%80%bd%e1%80%b1-%e1%80%81%e1%80%b6%e1%80%85%e1%80%ac%e1%80%b8%e1%80%9b%e1%80%94\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 32px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; line-height: 42px; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-block: 16px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); scroll-margin: 70px;\">ဘယ်လိုလက္ခဏာတွေ ခံစားရနိုင်လဲ။</h2></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px;\">သွေးတိုးရောဂါ (Hypertension) ဆိုတာက ခန္ဓာကိုယ်တွင်းက သွေးတွေကို ပုံမှန်ထက် ညှစ်ထုတ်ဖို့ခက်ခဲတဲ့အနေအထားမျိုးပါ။ <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">နှလုံး</span>က သွေးတွေကို ညှစ်ထုတ်ပေးနိုင်စွမ်းကျသွားတယ်ဆိုတဲ့ သဘောပါ။ ဒီလိုအခြေအနေမျိုးမှာ</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1rem; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; list-style: inside; max-width: 100%; margin-block: 16px; white-space: normal;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">မအီမသာဖြစ်တာ</span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">ခေါင်းတစ်ခြမ်းကိုက်</span>တာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">နှလုံးခုန်နှုန်း</span>&nbsp;ပုံမှန်မဟုတ်တာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">ချွေးစေးတွေပြန်တာမျိုး တွေ ခံစားရနိုင်ပါတယ်။ <br></span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><h2 id=\"%e1%80%9e%e1%80%bd%e1%80%b1%e1%80%b8%e1%80%90%e1%80%ad%e1%80%af%e1%80%b8-%e1%80%98%e1%80%ac%e1%80%80%e1%80%bc%e1%80%b1%e1%80%ac%e1%80%84%e1%80%b7%e1%80%ba%e1%80%96%e1%80%bc%e1%80%85%e1%80%ba%e1%80%9b\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 32px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; line-height: 42px; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-block: 16px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); scroll-margin: 70px;\">သွေးတိုး ဘာကြောင့်ဖြစ်ရတာလဲ။</h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px;\">သွေးတိုးရောဂါ ဖြစ်ရတဲ့ အကြောင်းအရင်းကို တိတိကျကျ မသိရသေးပါဘူး။ သွေးတိုးရောဂါဟာ ပတ်ဝန်းကျင်ရဲ့သက်ရောက်မှုကြောင့် ဖြစ်နိုင်သလို မျိုးရီုးဗီဇကြောင့်လည်း(မူလအစသွေးတိုးရောဂါ)ဖြစ်နိုင်ပါတယ်။ ဒါ့အပြင် ကျောက်ကပ်ရောဂါ ဒါမှမဟုတ် ဟော်မုန်း စနစ် မူမမှန်တာတွေကြောင့် (တဆင့်ခံ သွေးတိုးရောဂါ) ဖြစ်နိုင်ပါတယ်။ မူလအစ သွေးတိုးရောဂါကို ဖြစ်စေနိုင်တဲ့ အကြောင်းအရင်းတွေကတော့ ဆေးလိပ်သောက်တာ၊ မျိုးရိုး၊ ရှိသင့်တဲ့ ကိုယ်အလေးချိန်ထက် များနေတာ၊ အငန်ကဲတဲ့ အစားအစားတွေ စားတာ၊ အရက် အလွန်အကျွံ သောက်တာတွေကြောင့်ပါ။ စိတ်ဖိစီးမှု များတာကြောင့်လည်း သွေးတိုးနိုင်ပါတယ်။</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px;\">ဒီအချက်တွေအပြင်</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1rem; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; list-style: inside; max-width: 100%; margin-block: 16px; white-space: normal;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">ကဖင်း<span>&nbsp;</span></span>အသောက်များတာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">အချို့သောဆေးဝါးတွေသောက်သုံးနေရတာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">နာတာရှည်ကျောက်ကပ်ရောဂါရှိနေတာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">ကိုကင်းသုံးတာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">အက်ဒရီနယ်လင်ဂလင်းတွေ အရမ်း အလုပ်လုပ်လွန်းနေတာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">ကိုယ်ဝန်<span>&nbsp;</span></span>ရှိနေတာကြောင့် သွေးပေါင်ချိန် တက်လာတာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">ဆေးလိပ် သောက်တာ</span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">စိတ်ဖိစီးတာ</span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">သိုင်းရွိုက်ပြဿနာ ရှိနေတာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">အဝလွန် ​နေ</span>တာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">ဆီးချို<span>&nbsp;</span></span>ရှိနေတာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">သွေးတွင်းမှာ ပိုတက်ဆီယမ်၊ ကယ်လ်ဆီယမ် နဲ့ မဂ္ဂနီဆီယမ် ပမာဏနည်းနေတာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">ကိုယ်လက်လှုပ်ရှားမှု<span>&nbsp;</span></span>နည်းတာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">အယ်လ်ကိုဟောအသောက်များတာ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">အမျိုးသမီးတွေမှာဆိုရင်<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\"><span>&nbsp;</span>သန္ဓေတားဆေးတွေ</span>ကြာင့် ဟော်မုန်းအပြောင်းအလဲဖြစ်ပြီး သွေးတိုးနိုင်ပါတယ်။</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><h2 id=\"%e1%80%9e%e1%80%bd%e1%80%b1%e1%80%b8%e1%80%90%e1%80%ad%e1%80%af%e1%80%b8%e1%80%9b%e1%80%b1%e1%80%ac%e1%80%82%e1%80%ab-hypertension-%e1%80%80%e1%80%bc%e1%80%b1%e1%80%ac%e1%80%84%e1%80%b7%e1%80%ba\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 32px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; line-height: 42px; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-block: 16px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); scroll-margin: 70px;\">သွေးတိုးရောဂါ (Hypertension) ကြောင့် ဘာတွေ ခံစားလာရနိုင်လဲ။</h2></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 24px;\">အချိန်ကြာမြင့်စွာ သွေးတိုးရောဂါ ခံစားရတာက သွေးကြောနံရံတွေကို ပျက်စီးစေနိုင်ပြီး သွေးကြောတွေထဲမှာအနယ်တွေစုပုံတာမျိုး ဖြစ်စေနိုင်ပါတယ်။ သွေးတိုးတာက နှလုံးကို သွေးညှစ်ထုတ်ရာမှာ ခက်ခဲစေပြီး ခန္ဓာကိုယ် အစိတ်အပိုင်းတွေဆီကို သွေးစီးဆင်းရောက်ရှိမှု နည်းစေပြီး လေဖြတ်တာ၊ နှလုံးထိခိုက်ပျက်စီးတာတွေကို ဖြစ်စေနိုင်ပါတယ်။</p></div></div><p><br></p>', '2024-02-10 06:48:30', NULL, 1, 'သွေးတိုးရောဂါ-(Hypertension)', '3f87d5f39e440957dbcc7c8ba87caf25jpeg', NULL, 'admin', NULL);
INSERT INTO `tblposts` (`id`, `PostTitle`, `CategoryId`, `SubCategoryId`, `PostDetails`, `PostingDate`, `UpdationDate`, `Is_Active`, `PostUrl`, `PostImage`, `viewCounter`, `postedBy`, `lastUpdatedBy`) VALUES
(38, 'သွေးတိုးသမားတွေ သိထားဖို့ လိုမယ့် အန္တရာယ်ရှိတဲ့ လက္ခဏာတွေ', 8, 18, '<div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 24px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">သွေးတို</span>း တာက နာတာရှည် ကျန်းမာရေး ပြဿနာဖြစ်သလို အရမ်းပြင်းထန်မယ်ဆိုရင် အသက်အန္တရာယ် ထိခိုက်စေနိုင်ပါတယ်။ သွေးတိုးသမားတွေ သိထားဖို့ လိုမယ့် အန္တရာယ်ရှိတဲ့ လက္ခဏာတွေ က ဘာတွေလဲဆိုတာကို ပြောပြပေးချင်ပါတယ်။</p></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 26px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; line-height: 36px; letter-spacing: -0.8px; margin-block: 16px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; font-weight: inherit;\">ဘယ်လောက်ဆိုရင် သွေးတိုးနေပြီလို့ ဆိုနိုင်လဲ</strong></h3></div></div><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">ပုံမှန်ကတော့ သွေးပေါင်ချိန်က အပေါ်သွေး 120 mmHg အောက်သွေး 80 mmHg ဆိုရင် ပုံမှန် အခြေအနေလို့ ဆိုနိုင်ပါတယ်။ တကယ်လို့ အပေါ်သွေးက 120 mmHg ထက်ပိုများနေမယ်။ 120 mmHg – 139 mmHg ‌အောက်သွေးက 80 mmHg – 89 mmHg ဆိုရင် သွေးတိုး အစပျိုးနေတာ ဖြစ်ပြီး အပေါ်သွေးက 140 mmHg နဲ့ အောက်သွေးက 90 mmHg ဆိုရင်တော့ သွေးတိုး နေတာပါ။</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 24px; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">ဒါကို တစ်ကြိမ်တည်းတိုင်းကြည့်ရုံနဲ့ သွေးတိုးရှိနေပြီလို့ ဆုံးဖြတ်လို့ မရပါဘူး။ သေချာအောင် ဆေးရုံဆေးခန်းမှာ စနစ်တကျတိုင်းဖို့ လိုပါတယ်။</p><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 26px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; line-height: 36px; letter-spacing: -0.8px; margin-block: 16px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\">သွေးတိုးသမားတွေ သိထားဖို့ လိုမယ့် နောက်ဆက်တွဲပြဿနာတွေ</h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 24px;\">သွေးတိုး ရှိတာကို သေချာ ဂရုမစိုက်ဘူးဆိုရင် နောက်ဆက်တွဲ အနေနဲ့</p></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1rem; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; list-style: inside; max-width: 100%; margin-block: 16px; white-space: normal;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">ရုတ်တရက် နှလုံးရပ်တာ</span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">နှလုံးရောဂါ</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">လေဖြတ်တာ</span>တွေ ခံစားရနိုင်ပြီး အဆိုးဆုံးအနေနဲ့ အသက်ဆုံးရှုံးနိုင်ပါတယ်။</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-content \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-4 sc-3baca6de-6 sc-3baca6de-7 kHJUJG kVdaAH cGfJZj body-content article-content-wrapper\" data-size=\"small\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; width: 702px; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-line;\"><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 26px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; line-height: 36px; letter-spacing: -0.8px; margin-block: 16px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\">သွေးတိုးသမားတွေ သိထားဖို့ လိုမယ့် အန္တရာယ်ရှိတဲ့ လက္ခဏာတွေ က</h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 16px;\">သွေးတိုးသမားတွေ အခုလို <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%;\">လက္ခဏာတွေ</span> ခံစားရရင် နီးစပ်ရာ ဆေးခန်းကို အမြန်ဆုံး သွားရောက်သင့်ပါတယ်။</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1rem; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; list-style: inside; max-width: 100%; margin-block: 16px; white-space: normal;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">သွေးပေါင်ချိန် 180/120 mmHg အထက်</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">ခေါင်းကိုက်မယ်</span><span>&nbsp;</span>(ပြင်းပြင်းထန်ထန် ကိုက်တာမျိုး)</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">အမြင်တွေ ဝေဝါးလာမယ်</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">စိတ်ရှုပ်ထွေးမယ်</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">စိုးရိမ်စိတ်တွေ များလာမယ်</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">မအီမသာ ဖြစ်မယ်</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(45, 135, 243); max-width: 100%; display: initial;\">အသက်ရှူတာ ပြတ်တောင်းပြတ်တောင်</span>း ဖြစ်မယ်။</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; border: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0.4em; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative; list-style-type: none;\">ဘာလက္ခဏာမှ မရှိဘဲ သွေးတက်နေမယ်ဆိုရင်လည်း ဆေးခန်းသွားဖို့ လိုပါတယ်။</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; text-size-adjust: none; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); margin-block: 24px;\">သွေးတိုးကြောင့် အသက်အန္တရာယ် ထိခိုက်စေနိုင်တဲ့ လက္ခဏာတွေကတော့</p></div></div><div class=\"sc-3baca6de-13 gCRojo unique-co